          "EUR 700,000 is payable on the ordinary claim, EUR 1,750,000 on the single security loss, and EUR 350,000 on the two uncapped confidentiality losses. The overlapping security claims for the same loss are counted once, with confidentiality taking precedence where applicable."
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
